 "intro_html": "A soba-shop favourite: dashi turned into a glossy curry broth with <b>two cubes of Japanese curry roux</b>, pork and onion, poured over hot soba. The broth is Just One Cookbook’s curry udon; here it goes over soba. Same box of roux as the <a href=\"easy-curry.html\">easy Golden Curry</a>. For a clear broth, see <a href=\"kake-soba.html\">hot soba noodle soup</a>.",
