   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Break 2 cubes off the curry roux block (wrap the rest; it keeps 1–3 months in the fridge or freezer).</li><li>Make or warm the dashi — any method; see <a href=\"shiitake-kombu-dashi.html\">shiitake–kombu</a> or <a href=\"niboshi-bonito-dashi.html\">niboshi–bonito dashi</a>.</li><li>Thinly slice the onion and the green onions (the green onions are the garnish).</li></ul>",
