  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Pour in the dashi, cover and turn the heat to medium-low for 5 minutes.</li><li>Skim off the scum and fat with a fine-mesh skimmer, then simmer 5 more minutes.</li><li>Meanwhile, put a large pot of water on for the soba.</li></ul>",
