  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Turn the heat to the lowest setting or off — melting roux sinks and can scorch.</li><li>Put a cube in a ladleful of the hot stock, dissolve it completely with chopsticks or a spoon, then release it into the pot. Repeat with the second cube.</li></ul>",
