   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Boil the soba for <b>30 seconds less</b> than the packet says (no salt in the water).</li><li>Drain and rinse under cold running water, rubbing with your hand to wash off the starch.</li><li>Re-warm: a quick rinse under hot running water, or 5–8 seconds back in boiling water. Drain well.</li></ul>",
